        558.0009765625,
        412.62689208984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "such as [6] have proved to be too slow and computationally",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        415.6753234863281,
        558.0009155273438,
        424.5818786621094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "intensive for use in fast ﬂight. These challenges are further",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        427.6313171386719,
        558.0009765625,
        436.5378723144531
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "exacerbated by state and range-sensor uncertainty, which can",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        439.5863037109375,
        558.0009765625,
        448.49285888671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "dramatically impact map accuracy.",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        451.5412902832031,
        454.82830810546875,
        460.4478454589844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In this paper, we present an approach that leverages direct",
      "bbox": [
        323.16302490234375,
        463.519287109375,
        558.0014038085938,
        472.42584228515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "NMPC and an existing mapping framework, NanoMap [2],",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        475.4742736816406,
        558.0010375976562,
        484.3808288574219
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
